// The simulated SO-101's MCP surface: no leader node at all. The robot
// enrolls into the stack's robot_control_sim endpoint, the server built into
// peppy serving the robot_control:v1 exposure from the MCP hub, where a
// model drives every robot of the stack by name. The robot fragment enrolls
// the moves under this option, and the rig adds the front camera under it
// too; the robot's identity and limb state are listed there under any
// commander. Nothing streams into the backbone, whose upstream slots go
// vacant through no_commander.json5, the first part of this option; this
// part deploys nothing of its own.
{
  peppy_schema: "launcher_fragment/v1",

  deployments: [],
}
